1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,229
An ether has oxygen, but no hydrogen on it.

2
00:00:03,229 --> 00:00:05,325
There is nothing to reach across with.

3
00:00:05,325 --> 00:00:11,666
Ether molecules are held only by weak dipole and dispersion forces, just like pentane.

4
00:00:11,666 --> 00:00:15,351
So they fly apart at thirty four point six degrees.

5
00:00:15,351 --> 00:00:17,617
That is the eighty three degree gap.

